import java.util.HashMap;
import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;
import java.util.Optional;
import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;

/**
 * Tests of DebitAccount (legacy PAGODEB). Pins RULE-001 .. RULE-005.
 *
 * UNRESOLVED_DEPENDENCY: the 88-level CTA-ACTIVA lives in copybook CTAREG, which was not provided,
 * so the status value that means "active" is not known from the evidence. The constants ACTIVE and
 * INACTIVE below are the only place where that value is set for the tests and must be aligned
